description:
Generate 301/302/307/308 redirect rules for Apache .htaccess (mod_rewrite), nginx, Netlify _redirects or vercel.json from a list of 'source destination [code]' lines. A source ending in /* moves a whole folder. Also checks for loops, chains and duplicates and can add HTTPS and www/non-www rules.

Returns: JSON { platform, config (file text), ruleCount, issues[{ line, level, message }], notes[] }.
Example input: {"rules":"/old-page /new-page\n/blog/* /news/:splat 301","platform":"nginx"}
